263
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:50,240
Do you hear me?

264
00:20:50,360 --> 00:20:51,260
Fix it now!

265
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:52,340
Uh, yes, sir.

266
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:53,480
Hey!

267
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:57,060
Get back here, kid!

268
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:58,320
Are you nuts?

269
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:03,040
I'm not afraid of anything as long as I'm free.

270
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:05,400
I just have to be far away from here.

271
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:07,940
I have to follow my own dream.

272
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:13,940
Nobody's gonna change me.

273
00:21:13,940 --> 00:21:25,360
Give them a warm welcome, everyone!

274
00:21:43,940 --> 00:21:47,200
Oh, wow, that's one big ship.

275
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:49,420
It could run right over me easy.

276
00:21:50,260 --> 00:21:52,680
Heh, let's avoid that, shall we?

277
00:21:56,580 --> 00:21:58,400
Uh, uh, he's moving!

278
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,700
That almost got pretty ugly.

279
00:22:07,700 --> 00:22:09,440
What is this display?

280
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:11,940
Are the commoners attempting to welcome us?

281
00:22:12,340 --> 00:22:12,840
Yes, sir.

282
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,140
Huh?

283
00:22:15,660 --> 00:22:17,120
This is a first for me!

284
00:22:17,300 --> 00:22:20,120
The Celestial Dragons hardly ever make visits like this!

285
00:22:20,140 --> 00:22:21,860
I hope nobody mucks this up!

286
00:22:22,020 --> 00:22:23,960
We didn't burn all those people for nothing!

287
00:22:24,440 --> 00:22:27,560
By the way, what is that wretched little thing?

288
00:22:27,940 --> 00:22:28,220
Hmph.

289
00:22:29,340 --> 00:22:30,760
It seems to be a fishing boat, sir.

290
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:36,780
That's so cool!

291
00:22:36,780 --> 00:22:39,480
I hope I'm the captain of a big ship like that some day!

292
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:44,380
It's time to learn your place!

293
00:22:53,080 --> 00:22:54,480
Insolent fool!

294
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:56,320
What's going on?

295
00:22:56,700 --> 00:22:57,920
He just opened fire!

296
00:22:57,920 --> 00:23:14,260
Ace and Dadan return to their hideout safely after their battle with Blue Jam.

297
00:23:14,260 --> 00:23:20,480
However, the Mountain Bandits scarcely have time to celebrate before the news of Sabo's tragedy reaches their ears.

298
00:23:21,040 --> 00:23:26,440
Luffy despairs, Ace vows revenge, but a letter from Sabo changes their perspective.

299
00:23:26,440 --> 00:23:30,040
On the next, Wood Piece, take good care of him!

300
00:23:30,260 --> 00:23:31,540
A letter from the brother!

301
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,620
I will be king of the pirates!

